{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/838197-whats-the-attitude-of-someone-under-the-enslaved-or-enthralled-condition","id":838197,"title":"Whats the attitude of someone under the Enslaved or Enthralled condition??","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-27T13:34:21-08:00","id":838197,"title":"Whats the attitude of someone under the Enslaved or Enthralled condition??","content":"I planning for my vampire to put a detective under his control with the Conditioning devotion and started to wander, how would he live after being enslaved.<br /> Im not planning to micromanage his actions, just to give him long term orders that wouldnt be possible with simple mind control, but he would be living on his own most of the time.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","name":"Sakii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-27T13:43:47-08:00","id":838202,"title":"","content":"I see Enslaved as being like a constant state of Mesmerized. The character is more quiet and reserved than normal at the very least. I'd also say their independence suffers greatly - they don't know what to do with themselves in the absence of their master's commands. If commanded to carry out their daily routine as normal until instructed otherwise, they can probably imitate themselves well enough to get by. But someone who knows them well might observe that they've lost their motivation and creative flair, like they're sleepwalking through their lives. A psychologically inclined person might suspect they were suffering from depression.<br /> <br /> EDIT: For a more concrete example Congressman Murray from Parks and Rec was clearly under Conditioning.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 02-27-2016, 04:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-27T15:37:09-08:00","id":838249,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the explanation.<br /> <br /> Im guessing that someone Enthralled or blood bound would act distracted, like there was another place the would rather to be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","name":"Sakii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-28T19:41:28-08:00","id":838924,"title":"","content":"Enthralled:<br /> <br /> I think that it would depend on the person. Your being enthralled makes you emphatically loyal and eager to please. If your master told you to go do something, you wouldnt act like there was somewhere else you wanted to be. You would act like that is the only thing in the world that means something to you... getting the job done and right. Everyone acts differently.. Read the flavor text for the conditions.<br /> <br /> Enslaved<br /> Perhaps a like your mezmerized.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2308,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","user":"Vitalis","date":". 02-28-2016, 10:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-28T20:14:54-08:00","id":838938,"title":"","content":"I meant how would you live your normal life while under the effect of Enthralled or blood bound. Without having orders to follow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","name":"Sakii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T08:12:00-08:00","id":839184,"title":"","content":"Like a normal person who is completely devoted or in love with someone else. You would go about your day always thinking of them and how to make them happy. Think of someone who is completely devoted to God. or someone who worships their lover. Or even ... Norman Bates. There are hundreds of ways to play it out. It would really depend on the personality of the person who is Enthralled... and what the Master treats them like.<br /> <br /> Also Blood Bond, Enthralled, And Enslaved all have slightly different effects and flavor texts so the results of each would be slightly different... <br /> <br /> Enthralled is emphatically loyal.<br /> Blood Bond is more like Deeply obsessively in love<br /> Enslaved is more like mesmerized.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}